# Please refer to https://github.com/SinghLabUCSF/Ohnologs-v2.0 (Singh 2019) for detailed pipeline.
# The Ohnologs-v2.0 GitHub repository has NO LICENSE file, so I am not sure if I can put some of the modified scripts into this directory.
#
# The phylogenetic weighting step used in the Ohnologs-v2 pipeline was originally performed using the notebook calculate_phylogenetic_weighting.ipynb, which is no longer included here because we no longer use it. Since the phylogenetic weighting script is not provided in their GitHub repository, we implemented our own version based on the descriptions in Singh (2019). Our implementation reproduces the expected results with only minor differences.
# In the most recent iteration of our ohnolog analysis, we no longer compute phylogenetic weighting ourselves; instead, we use the phylogenetic weighting scores provided in their GitHub repository.
# Final results are output as files with the extension *.ohnologs.txt.

